### 1. Create seed books =======================================================

### Create seed book 1: Clean Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorsText": "Robert C. Martin",
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "subtitle": "A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "isbn": "{{book1Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book1Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 2: Domain-Driven Design
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorsText": "Eric Evans",
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "subtitle": "Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software",
  "isbn": "{{book2Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book2Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 3: Refactoring
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorsText": "Martin Fowler, Kent Beck",
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "subtitle": "Improving the Design of Existing Code",
  "isbn": "{{book3Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book3Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 4: Design Patterns
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorsText": "Erich Gamma, Richard Helm, Ralph Johnson, John Vlissides",
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "subtitle": "Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software",
  "isbn": "{{book4Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book4Id}}"
}
